## Third-party components

LogSherlock orchestrates open-source software. Their licences apply to their
respective components:

- LangGraph — MIT
- FastAPI, Pydantic, SQLAlchemy, Alembic, Uvicorn — MIT / BSD
- Ollama SDK (MIT), Google Gen AI SDK (Apache-2.0), OpenAI SDK (Apache-2.0)

Model weights are **not** bundled with this project and carry their own
licences and usage terms. For example, Gemma weights are distributed by Google
under the Gemma Terms of Use, which are separate from this project's MIT
licence. Review the licence for whichever model you configure before using it
commercially.

No performance benchmark or latency claim in this repository has been measured
on documented hardware. Verify any figure yourself before relying on it.